요"}, {"block_index": 240, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 252, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 253", "text": "입 찰 공 고"}, {"block_index": 241, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 253, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 254", "text": "(지 명) 번 호"}, {"block_index": 242, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 254, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 255", "text": "입 찰 일 자"}, {"block_index": 243, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 255, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 256", "text": "2026 년 월 일"}, {"block_index": 244, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 256, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 257", "text": "입 찰 건 명"}, {"block_index": 245, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 257, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 258", "text": "입 찰 보 증 금"}, {"block_index": 246, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 258, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 259", "text": "납부면제 및 지급확약"}, {"block_index": 247, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 259, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 260", "text": "본인은 낙찰 후 계약 미체결 시 귀 법인에 낙찰금액의 5/100에 해당하는 입찰보증금을 현금으로 납부할 것을 확약합니다."}, {"block_index": 248, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 260, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 261", "text": "대"}, {"block_index": 249, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 261, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 262", "text": "리"}, {"block_index": 250, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 262, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 263", "text": "인"}, {"block_index": 251, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 263, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 264", "text": "."}, {"block_index": 252, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 264, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 265", "text": "사"}, {"block_index": 253, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 265, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 266", "text": "용"}, {"block_index": 254, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 266, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 267", "text": "인"}, {"block_index": 255, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 267, "location":